OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies after car leaves road
OL,4,Aat roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 60s died after the car he
OL,7,Fwas driving left the road at a
OL,8,Froundabout.
OL,10,FNorfolk Police said the black Jeep
OL,11,FGrand Cherokee left the carriageway at
OL,12,FGrimston Road in King's Lynn at about
OL,13,F23:00 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FThe road was closed while emergency
OL,16,Fservices attended, and officers asked
OL,17,Fanyone who witnessed the collision or
OL,18,Fhas dashcam footage of the manner of
OL,19,Fdriving prior to the collision to get
OL,20,Fin touch.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
